DarkFactory takes nothing
Rock products
Let products at "button" be "Dark Button"
Let products at "checkbox" be "Dark Checkbox"
Give back products
End

LightFactory takes nothing
Rock products
Let products at "button" be "Light Button"
Let products at "checkbox" be "Light Checkbox"
Give back products
End

RenderFamily takes factory
Shout factory at "button"
Shout factory at "checkbox"
End

Put DarkFactory! into chosen
RenderFamily taking chosen

Put LightFactory! into chosen
RenderFamily taking chosen
